  "name": "Journey Together Build & Battle Box",
  "category": "product_promotion",
  "description": {
    "text": "Given to players at the Journey Together prerelease tournaments on the weekends of 15–16 and 22–23 March 2025, and sold by shops in the Prerelease Program. Each box held four Journey Together booster packs and a 40-card deck built around one of four promos with the Journey Together logo. The decks also held non-holo copies of Iono's Kilowattrel and Noivern, which booster packs have only in holofoil.",
